==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|dreadfull}} & {{l|en|dredful}} {{qualifier|obsolete}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|enm|dredful}} &c. and {{m|enm|dreful}}, equivalent to {{suffix|dread|ful|lang=en}}.

